<!--
  Business — sitemap.

  ONE URL, and that is not an oversight. The game has no router and no path
  handling of any kind: signing in, the front door, the lobby and the board
  are all states of the same page. So there is no second address to list, and
  nothing here was invented to pad it out.

  Nothing private appears for the same reason. Accounts, game sessions and
  anybody's holdings are not reachable at a URL — they are state behind a
  sign-in, or rows a publishable key cannot read. There is no page to exclude.

  Update `lastmod` when the page changes in a way a search engine should care
  about. It is a hint, not a promise, and a date that never moves is worth
  less than no date at all.
-->
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
  <url>
    <loc>https://businesss-gilt.vercel.app/</loc>
    <lastmod>2026-10-15</lastmod>
    <changefreq>weekly</changefreq>
    <priority>1.0</priority>
  </url>
</urlset>
